{"id":"graphite","name":"Graphite","tagline":"Real-time strategy on a graph: grow your bases, send fleets, take the map.","seats":[{"id":"red","name":"Red","color":"#bb3933"},{"id":"blue","name":"Blue","color":"#2c5ba6"},{"id":"green","name":"Green","color":"#36845b"}],"tick_seconds":0.1,"max_ticks":1800,"rating_anchor":["strategic_ai",1000.0],"rules":"Graphite is played on a map of bases joined by routes. Every player starts with\none or more bases; the rest are neutral. The last player with any bases or\nfleets left wins. A match that is still undecided after three minutes of game\ntime is a draw between everyone still in it.\n\n## Bases and fleets\n\n- An owned base produces units all the time, at the rate on its badge (for\n  example `+1.5/s`). Neutral bases don't produce.\n- Each tick, a player may send one fleet: a whole number of units from one of\n  its bases along a route to a neighbouring base. The fleet takes the route's\n  travel time to arrive (the label on the route).\n- A fleet arriving at its own side's base reinforces it. Arriving anywhere else,\n  it fights.\n\n## Ticks\n\nA tick is 0.1 seconds of game time, and every tick runs in the same order:\n\n1. Every player sees the same state and chooses at most one action.\n2. All valid actions are applied at once and their fleets depart together.\n3. Owned bases produce units.\n4. Fleets move.\n5. All fleets arriving at one base are resolved together.\n\n## Fights\n\nAll units at a base, the defenders and every arriving fleet, are pooled by\nowner. The largest force wins and keeps the difference between itself and the\nsecond largest. If the two largest are equal, the base becomes neutral with no\nunits. Because arrivals are resolved together, the order in which players act\nnever matters.\n\n## For bots\n\nA bot sees the whole board: every base, route and fleet, its own seat and the\ntime. It never sees map names, so it has to read the graph rather than\nrecognise a map. Two-player maps seat Red and Blue; three-player maps add Green.\n","theme":{"id":"paper_atlas","name":"Paper Atlas","description":"Warm field-notes paper, ink lines and brush-stroke factions.","colors":{"ink":"#2a2825","paper":"#efe7d6","paper_light":"#f9f3e6","paper_dark":"#dacdb5","muted":"#696053","disabled":"#9d9485","highlight":"#d3a42f","white":"#fffaf0"},"players":{"red":{"fill":"#bb3933","dark":"#842724"},"blue":{"fill":"#2c5ba6","dark":"#1f3d6f"},"green":{"fill":"#36845b","dark":"#235b3e"}},"neutral":{"fill":"#dacdb5"}},"maps":[{"id":"classic","name":"Classic","seats":["red","blue"],"description":"5 bases, 8 routes","board":{"name":"classic","width":1000,"height":800,"bases":[{"id":"west_home","x":100,"y":400,"production":1.15},{"id":"north","x":500,"y":133,"production":1.0},{"id":"center","x":500,"y":400,"production":1.45},{"id":"south","x":500,"y":666,"production":0.2},{"id":"east_home","x":900,"y":400,"production":1.15}],"edges":[{"a":"west_home","b":"north","time":5},{"a":"west_home","b":"center","time":5},{"a":"west_home","b":"south","time":5},{"a":"east_home","b":"north","time":5},{"a":"east_home","b":"center","time":5},{"a":"east_home","b":"south","time":5},{"a":"north","b":"center","time":3},{"a":"center","b":"south","time":4}]},"start":{"bases":{"west_home":["red",20],"north":["",20],"center":["",25],"south":["",4],"east_home":["blue",20]},"fleets":{}}},{"id":"crossroads","name":"Crossroads","seats":["red","blue"],"description":"10 bases, 17 routes","board":{"name":"crossroads","width":1000,"height":800,"bases":[{"id":"red_post","x":85,"y":400,"production":1.2},{"id":"north_farm","x":280,"y":175,"production":0.8},{"id":"south_mine","x":275,"y":625,"production":1.0},{"id":"upper_gate","x":465,"y":225,"production":1.35},{"id":"crossroads","x":500,"y":400,"production":2.2},{"id":"lower_gate","x":470,"y":580,"production":1.2},{"id":"north_mine","x":720,"y":165,"production":1.0},{"id":"east_post","x":765,"y":400,"production":1.4},{"id":"south_farm","x":725,"y":635,"production":0.8},{"